ssage%22%3A%22Your%20lies%20have%20sown%20enough%20discord%20and%20chaos%20among%20my%20people.%20How%20convenient%20that%20you%E2%80%99re%20here%3B%20I%20can%20capture%20both%20you%20and%20Maddock%20at%20the%20same%20time.%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%5D%7D%5D%7D%2C%7B%22tag%22%3A%22event%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22name%22%3A%22turn%209%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter_condition%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%7B%22tag%22%3A%22have_unit%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22Lisar%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%5D%7D%2C%7B%22tag%22%3A%22message%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22speaker%22%3A%22Maddock%22%2C%22message%22%3A%22Elensefar%20has%20weathered%20countless%20storms%2C%20Your%20Highness.%20Your%20queen%20will%20be%20neither%20the%20first%20nor%20the%20last%20that%20breaks%20upon%20our%20shores.%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%2C%7B%22tag%22%3A%22message%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22speaker%22%3A%22Lisar%22%2C%22message%22%3A%22You%E2%80%99ve%20been%20a%20capable%20lord%2C%20Maddock%2C%20and%20from%20what%20I%20can%20tell%20you%20truly%20care%20about%20your%20city.%20If%20it%E2%80%99s%20any%20consolation%2C%20when%20all%E2%80%99s%20said%20and%20done%20I%20intend%20to%20make%20sure%20you%20stand%20a%20fair%20trial.%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%2C%7B%22tag%22%3A%22message%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22speaker%22%3A%22Lisar%22%2C%22message%22%3A%22As%20for%20you%2C%20Delfador...%20you%E2%80%99re%20going%20to%20regret%20what%20you%20did%20to%20my%20brother.%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%5D%7D%5D%7D",
              },
